    "preamble": "Palash Ghosh vs Unknown on 31 December, 2020 Author: Saugata Bhattacharyya Bench: Saugata Bhattacharyya 31.12.2020 Item no.15 Ct.8 Kaushik/Chc Rejected C.R.M. No.11298 of 2020 In Re:- An application for anticipatory bail under section 438 of the Code of Criminal Procedure in connection with Krishnagar Kotwali Police Station Case No.835 of 2019 dated 02.12.2019 under Section 272 of the Indian Penal Code and Section 57 of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006. And In the matter of:-",
